          "filename": "First Test, between England and India at Trent Bridge, Nottingham - 2014.jpg",
          "caption": "A couple of snapshots taken from the Larwood and Voce Stand at the First Test, between England and India at Trent Bridge, Nottingham. We've had glorious weather (despite the Met Office predicting rain) and some great and not-so-great cricket. Just like last year here (against Australia), we've had a big stand for the opposition's last wicket and the regulation England batting collapse, but as of the end of the third day, England are still in with the chance of avoiding another defeat, thanks to Joe Root and Jimmy Anderson.",
